@InsuranceManagement.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5295

### List countries
GET {{InsuranceManagement.API_HostAddress}}/api/countries
Accept: application/json

### List counties
GET {{InsuranceManagement.API_HostAddress}}/api/counties
Accept: application/json

### List cities
GET {{InsuranceManagement.API_HostAddress}}/api/cities
Accept: application/json